# Story 5: the end. The city's grateful, so Harlow flies the blondes he
# saved (and a crate of whiskey) to a party in his honour...
picture chief_office.jpg

Mayor: Harlow, the city is grateful. The young ladies you rescued are throwing you a party, out at the beach.

Chief: Just fly them there, Harlow. Straight there.

Harlow: Leave it to me, Chief. Somebody load that crate of whiskey.
